WEBVTT

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:00.096
Because without investing
in an education that values --

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:02.256
WG: Both the stories --
PV: And statistics --

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:04.176
WG: The people --
PV: And the numbers --

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.456
WG: The interpersonal --
PV: And the systemic --

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:08.936
WG: There will always be a piece missing.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.616
PV: Today, so few of us
understand each other.

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:14.536
WG: We don't know how to communicate --

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:16.536
PV: Live together --
WG: Love one another.

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:19.656
We need to all work together
to create a new national community.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:23.416
PV: A new shared culture
of mutual suffering and celebration.

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:27.256
WG: We need to each begin by learning
in our own local communities,

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:30.216
bridging the gaps between
our own hearts and minds